<title>FRANCE: Rouen Jan 1-8 flour exports at 12,500 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Jan 1-8 flour exports at 12,500 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 12,500 tonnes between January 1 and January 8, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The flour was shipped to West Africa.</p>
<p>Flour exports totalled 97,000 tonnes in the whole of January 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
